---
// Analytics (design §18.12), off unless configured.
//
// Netlify Analytics needs nothing here: it counts server-side from the CDN
// logs, sets no cookie and runs no script in the browser, so there is nothing
// to add to the page and no consent banner to show.
//
// A privacy-friendly script (Plausible, GoatCounter, Umami, Fathom) needs one
// tag, which this adds when PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SRC is set - with the site's own
// domain in PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN where the script wants one. Nothing is
// loaded when they are unset, which is the default and the state of the build
// until a service is chosen.
//
// Whatever goes here must not set a cookie or identify a reader: reading
// progress lives in the reader's own browser and is nobody else's business.
const src = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_SRC;
const domain = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_DOMAIN;
---
{src && <script is:inline defer src={src} data-domain={domain} data-website-id={domain}></script>}
